---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Support | The Royal House of Engagement" description="Support information for Low Value Content orders and product questions.">
  <article class="plain-page"><header><p class="eyebrow">Royal Office of Practical Matters</p><h1>Support, plainly stated.</h1><p>For product and order questions, email <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a>.</p></header><div class="rows">
    <section><h2>Order status</h2><p>Use the private order status link from checkout to see payment, production, and shipping updates. Include that link when contacting support. Keep it private because anyone with the link can view your order status.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Shipping</h2><p>We currently ship to US addresses. Standard shipping is $5.99 per order; any applicable tax is shown at checkout. Shirts are made after you order, so production and delivery times may vary. Tracking appears on your order status page when available.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Returns and replacements</h2><p>See <a href="/returns.html">Returns and replacements</a>. If a shirt does not fit, you can return it within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the item price, or exchange it for another size. Email <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a> first and we will send return instructions. Shirts must be unworn and unwashed; you pay return shipping, and original shipping is not refunded. If yours arrives damaged, misprinted, or wrong, contact us within 30 days of delivery with your order status link and a photo. We will arrange a replacement or refund. Your rights under applicable law still apply.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Sizing and care</h2><p>Check the selected size and color before paying. Follow the garment care label to help protect the print.</p></section>
  </div></article>
</BaseLayout>
